  "title": "Air Fryer Salmon and Asparagus for One",
  "description": "Salmon and asparagus are a wonderful combination cooked in the air fryer in this quick meal for one, that is ready in about 20 minutes.",
  "authors": [
    "Rebekah Rose Hills"
  ],
